TF-M token: ok, lifecycle 0x3003, 4 software components, profile http://arm.com/CCA-SSD/1.0.0
TF-M token, other CPAK: bad signature: the CPAK did not sign the platform token
TF-M token, tampered: bad signature: the CPAK did not sign the platform token
fresh: appraised, Arm CCA, platform policy too
again: not fresh: challenge already accepted, or exported
not secured: refused (appraise_evidence): the platform's security lifecycle 0x2000 is not secured
platform bound to another realm: bad signature: the platform token is not bound to this realm's RAK
other challenge: not fresh: the evidence does not carry this challenge
under another CPAK only: refused (verify_evidence): no root or key in the trust set fits this Arm CCA evidence (bad signature: the CPAK did not sign the platform token)
a 32-byte challenge: not fresh: this platform carries a 64-byte challenge: issue it with challenge_issue(64)
released and opened: same key
